There is a storybook called Story whose scene is "" and whose challenger is "" and whose gym trainer beaten is 0 and whose forest one beaten is 0 and whose forest two beaten is 0 and whose forest three beaten is 0 and whose grass steps is 0 and whose route rival beaten is 0 and whose recovery place is "Home".

The dialogue transitions are next scene and dialogue, in that order:
  "oak warning" has "oak lab" and "OAK: Come with me!".
  "brock cash" has "brock badge" and "BROCK: I took you for granted. As proof of your victory, here's the BOULDERBADGE!".
