  "brock tm" has "brock tm received" and "Wait! Take this with you!".
  "brock explanation" has "" and "A TM contains a technique that can be taught to POKEMON! A TM is good only once! TM34 contains BIDE! Your POKEMON will absorb damage in battle then pay it back double!".

