  Set Journey's mode to "dialogue".

To engage:
  Challenge Story's challenger.
  Set Orders's phase to "commands".
  Set Orders's cursor to 1.
  Set Journey's mode to "battle".

To finish:
  Let the transition be the dialogue transitions for Story's scene.
  If the transition is not nothing:
    Set Story's scene to the transition's next scene.
    Speak the transition's dialogue.
    Stop.
  Depending on Story's scene:
    For "mart parcel":
      Set Story's scene to "".
      Set Journey's column to 2.
      Set Journey's row to 4.
      Set Journey's facing to "north".
      Set Journey's parcel to 1.
      Sound "item".
      Set Journey's objective to "Deliver OAK's PARCEL to his lab in PALLET TOWN.".
      Speak "CLERK: You know PROF. OAK, right? His order came in. Will you take it to him? You got OAK's PARCEL!".
    For "oak lab":
      Set Story's scene to "".
      Set Journey's place to "Oak's Lab".
      Set Journey's column to 5.
      Set Journey's row to 4.
      Set Journey's facing to "north".
      Set Journey's stage to "choose starter".
      Set Journey's objective to "Choose a Pokemon from Oak's table.".
      Speak "OAK: There are 3 POKEMON here! Choose one!".
    For "starter chosen":
      Set Story's scene to "".
      Speak "{Journey's rival}: I'll take this one, then! {Journey's rival} received {Journey's rival starter}!".
    For "brock badge":
      Set Story's scene to "brock advice".
      Sound "badge".
      Speak "{Journey's trainer} received the BOULDERBADGE!".
    For "brock tm received":
      Set Journey's tm34 to 1.
      Set Journey's objective to "Brock awarded you the Boulder Badge and TM34.".
      Set Story's scene to "brock explanation".
      Sound "item".
      Speak "{Journey's trainer} received TM34!".
    For "deliver parcel":
      Set Story's scene to "".
      Set Journey's parcel to 0.
      Set Journey's dex to 1.
      Set Journey's stage to "pokedex".
      Set Journey's objective to "Travel through Viridian Forest to Pewter Gym.".
      Speak "OAK: This is my invention, POKEDEX! It automatically records data on POKEMON you've seen or caught!".
    For "trainer challenge":
      Set Story's scene to "".
      Engage.
    Otherwise:
      Let the opponent be the challenge opponents for Story's scene.
      If the opponent is not nothing:
        Set Story's scene to "".
        Set Story's challenger to the opponent's challenger.
        Engage.
      Otherwise:
        Set Story's scene to "".
        Set Journey's mode to "walk".
        Set Journey's message to "".

To choose:
