  Record.
  Set Journey's stage to "rival battle".
  Set Story's scene to "starter chosen".
  Speak "OAK: This POKEMON is really energetic! {Journey's trainer} received {Journey's starter}!".

To resolve:
  If Combat's outcome is "":
    Stop.
  If Combat's outcome is "fainted":
    Replace.
    If Combat's outcome is "":
      Stop.
  If Combat's outcome is one of "escaped" or "caught":
    Set Combat's outcome to "".
    Set Story's challenger to "".
    Set Journey's mode to "walk".
