      Speak "You blacked out! Your POKEMON was restored.".
  If Story's challenger is "rival":
    Set Journey's stage to "parcel".
    Set Journey's objective to "Visit the Viridian City MART.".
    If Combat's outcome is "win":
      Speak "RIVAL: WHAT? Unbelievable! I picked the wrong POKEMON!".
    Otherwise:
      Speak "RIVAL: Yeah! Am I great or what?".
  If Story's challenger is "route rival":
