      Set Journey's route rival beaten to 1.
      Speak "RIVAL: What? I was just careless!".
    Otherwise:
      Speak "RIVAL: You have to work harder than that!".
  If Story's challenger is "brock":
    If Combat's outcome is "win" and Journey's badge is 0:
      Set Journey's badge to 1.
      Add 1386 to Journey's wallet.
      Set Journey's stage to "boulder badge".
      Set Journey's objective to "Receive the BOULDERBADGE and TM34 from BROCK.".
      Set Story's scene to "brock cash".
      Speak "{Journey's trainer} got 1386 for winning!".
    Otherwise if Combat's outcome is "loss":
      Speak "You blacked out! Heal your POKEMON and challenge BROCK again.".
  If Story's challenger is "gym trainer":
    If Combat's outcome is "win":
      Set Story's gym trainer beaten to 1.
      Speak "GYM TRAINER: Darn! Light years isn't time, it measures distance!".
    Otherwise:
      Speak "You blacked out! Heal your POKEMON before trying again.".
  If Story's challenger is "forest one":
