      Set Story's forest one beaten to 1.
    Speak "BUG CATCHER: You're a POKEMON trainer too!".
  If Story's challenger is "forest two":
    If Combat's outcome is "win":
      Set Story's forest two beaten to 1.
    Speak "BUG CATCHER: I give up! You're good at this!".
  If Story's challenger is "forest three":
    If Combat's outcome is "win":
      Set Story's forest three beaten to 1.
    Speak "BUG CATCHER: No! Caterpie can't hack it!".
  If Combat's outcome is "loss" and Story's challenger is not "rival":
    Revive.
    Set Journey's wallet to (Journey's wallet / 2) rounded down to the nearest 1.
    Set Journey's place to Story's recovery place.
    Set Journey's column to 3.
    Set Journey's row to 6.
    If Story's recovery place is "Home":
      Set Journey's column to 2.
    Set Journey's facing to "north".
    Speak "{Journey's trainer} is out of usable POKEMON! {Journey's trainer} blacked out!".
  Set Combat's outcome to "".
  Set Story's challenger to "".

To meet a visitor (text):
