To enter a key (text):
  If the key is "left":
    Subtract 1 from Journey's selection.
    If Journey's selection is less than 0:
      Set Journey's selection to 29.
  If the key is "right":
    Add 1 to Journey's selection.
    If Journey's selection is more than 29:
      Set Journey's selection to 0.
  If the key is "up":
    Subtract 6 from Journey's selection.
    If Journey's selection is less than 0:
      Add 30 to Journey's selection.
  If the key is "down":
    Add 6 to Journey's selection.
    If Journey's selection is more than 29:
      Subtract 30 from Journey's selection.
  Let the inscription be Journey's trainer.
  If Journey's mode is "custom rival naming":
    Set the inscription to Journey's rival.
  If the key is "b" or (the key is "a" and Journey's selection is 28):
    If the length of the inscription is more than 0:
      Set the inscription to the first (the length of the inscription - 1) letters of the inscription.
  If the key is "a" and Journey's selection is less than 26 and the length of the inscription is less than 7:
    Let the alphabet be "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ".
    Let the letter be the first 1 letters of the last (26 - Journey's selection) letters of the alphabet.
    Set the inscription to "{the inscription}{the letter}".
  If Journey's mode is "custom naming":
    Set Journey's trainer to the inscription.
  Otherwise:
    Set Journey's rival to the inscription.
  If the key is "start" or (the key is "a" and Journey's selection is 29):
    If the inscription is not "":
      If Journey's mode is "custom naming":
        Nominate.
      Otherwise:
        Begin.

To advance a key (text):
  If Journey's mode is "battle":
    Command the key.
    Resolve.
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "opening":
    If (the key is one of "start" or "a") or Journey's animation is at least 144:
      Set Journey's mode to "title".
      Set Journey's animation to 0.
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "title":
    If the key is one of "start" or "a":
      Set Journey's mode to "menu".
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "menu":
    If the key is one of "start" or "a":
      Set Journey's mode to "intro".
      Set Journey's selection to 0.
      Set Journey's message to "OAK: Hello there! Welcome to the world of POKEMON! My name is OAK! People call me the POKEMON PROF!".
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "intro":
    If the key is one of "a" or "start":
      Let the intro remainder be the caption remainder for Journey's message.
      If the intro remainder is not "":
        Set Journey's message to the intro remainder.
        Stop.
      If Journey's selection is 0:
        Set Journey's selection to 1.
        Set Journey's message to "OAK: This world is inhabited by creatures called POKEMON! For some people, POKEMON are pets. Others use them for fights.".
      Otherwise:
        Set Journey's selection to 0.
        Set Journey's mode to "naming".
        Set Journey's message to "OAK: First, what is your name? Choose a name.".
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is one of "naming" or "rival naming":
    If the key is one of "up" or "left":
      Subtract 1 from Journey's selection.
      If Journey's selection is less than 0:
        Set Journey's selection to 3.
    If the key is one of "down" or "right":
      Add 1 to Journey's selection.
      If Journey's selection is more than 3:
        Set Journey's selection to 0.
    If the key is one of "a" or "start":
      If Journey's mode is "naming":
        If Journey's selection is 0:
          Set Journey's trainer to "".
          Set Journey's mode to "custom naming".
          Stop.
        Set Journey's trainer to "RED".
        If Journey's selection is 2:
          Set Journey's trainer to "ASH".
        If Journey's selection is 3:
          Set Journey's trainer to "JACK".
        Nominate.
      Otherwise:
        If Journey's selection is 0:
          Set Journey's rival to "".
          Set Journey's mode to "custom rival naming".
          Stop.
        Set Journey's rival to "BLUE".
        If Journey's selection is 2:
          Set Journey's rival to "GARY".
        If Journey's selection is 3:
          Set Journey's rival to "JOHN".
        Begin.
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is one of "custom naming" or "custom rival naming":
    Enter the key.
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "dialogue":
    If the key is one of "a", "b" or "start":
      Let the remainder be the caption remainder for Journey's message.
      If the remainder is not "":
        Set Journey's message to the remainder.
      Otherwise:
        Finish.
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "starter":
    If the key is "a":
      Choose.
    If the key is "b":
      Set Journey's mode to "walk".
      Set Journey's message to "".
    Stop.
  If Journey's mode is "walk":
    If the key is one of "up", "down", "left" or "right":
      Walk toward the key.
    If the key is "a":
      If Journey's place is "Bedroom" and Journey's row is 2 and Journey's column is 3 and Journey's facing is "north" and Stock's pc taken is 0:
        Set Stock's pc taken to 1.
        Add 1 to Stock's potions.
        Sound "item".
        Speak "Withdrew a POTION from the PC!".
      Otherwise:
        If the person ahead is not "":
          Meet the person ahead.
        Otherwise:
          Examine.
























